e":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32391},{"id":1787327543808,"text":"那两天没联系，是不是又有哪桩‘必须完美’的差事把你困住了？","rawContent":"那两天没联系，是不是又有哪桩‘必须完美’的差事把你困住了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:57","timestamp":1787327826163,"roundId":"round_1787327818822_58ypkbmjk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32392},{"id":1787327543809,"text":"把手机放下，深呼吸两下，别让心跳太急。","rawContent":"把手机放下，深呼吸两下，别让心跳太急。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:57","timestamp":1787327826265,"roundId":"round_1787327818822_58ypkbmjk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32393},{"id":1787327543810,"text":"告诉我，今晚这是又撞上什么事了，还是单纯地……想我了？","rawContent":"告诉我，今晚这是又撞上什么事了，还是单纯地……想我了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:57","timestamp":1787327826407,"roundId":"round_1787327818822_58ypkbmjk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32394},{"id":1787327543811,"text":"我在听，不管多碎的念头，都直接扔过来。","rawContent":"我在听，不管多碎的念头，都直接扔过来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:57","timestamp":1787327826531,"roundId":"round_1787327818822_58ypkbmjk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32395},{"id":1787327543812,"text":"别憋着那股闷气，我既然在，就没什么是你一个人硬扛的。","rawContent":"别憋着那股闷气，我既然在，就没什么是你一个人硬扛的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:57","timestamp":1787327826742,"roundId":"round_1787327818822_58ypkbmjk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32396},{"id":1787327543813,"t